{
  "movie_id": 520900601,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 4.3,
      "end_time": 9.7,
      "text": "D-D-Don't tell me the curse hasn't been lifted yet..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 10.3,
      "end_time": 12.0,
      "text": "No way..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 12.3,
      "end_time": 13.5,
      "text": "...Everyonesh"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 14.5,
      "end_time": 16.5,
      "text": "THAT mightsh work now"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 17.0,
      "end_time": 18.1,
      "text": "Lului-chan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 18.7,
      "end_time": 19.8,
      "text": "The kissh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 20.8,
      "end_time": 21.8,
      "text": "Huh...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 22.1,
      "end_time": 23.4,
      "text": "The kissh, remembersh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 23.6,
      "end_time": 26.8,
      "text": "We'll use the Princesh blessingsh to removesh the curse"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 27.2,
      "end_time": 28.7,
      "text": "H-However..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 29.1,
      "end_time": 34.2,
      "text": "Now that she hash a bodysh, the bondsh will also be deepersh"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 34.6,
      "end_time": 35.7,
      "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 36.0,
      "end_time": 37.2,
      "text": "K-Kishi-sa?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 37.6,
      "end_time": 41.2,
      "text": "Big Shis Yukino, if you also helpsh the effectsh will be doubledsh"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 41.3,
      "end_time": 43.0,
      "text": "Oh, me too!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 47.2,
      "end_time": 49.6,
      "text": "Ugh... I'm so scared..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 49.8,
      "end_time": 53.5,
      "text": "If I'm not careful, I might freeze the both of them"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 55.1,
      "end_time": 61.4,
      "text": "(Mm... Mmm. But I didn't freeze Kishi-sa when he touched me earlier)"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 62.1,
      "end_time": 65.6,
      "text": "(If I muster up my courage again...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 66.4,
      "end_time": 71.9,
      "text": "(Th-That's right. This isn't fear. M-My heart is racing...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 74.8,
      "end_time": 76.9,
      "text": "I-I'll also help, then...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 77.5,
      "end_time": 80.2,
      "text": "B-Big Shis Yukino?! You're meltingsh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 80.7,
      "end_time": 81.9,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 84.7,
      "end_time": 87.1,
      "text": "AWAWAWAWA?! EEEK!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 87.3,
      "end_time": 88.3,
      "text": "Yukino-san"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 89.7,
      "end_time": 91.4,
      "text": "K-Kishi-sa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 92.0,
      "end_time": 95.2,
      "text": "(N-Now I'm getting even more excited...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 96.7,
      "end_time": 98.0,
      "text": "Kyan!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 98.7,
      "end_time": 99.6,
      "text": "Ah"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 99.9,
      "end_time": 101.3,
      "text": "Mm"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 105.0,
      "end_time": 107.7,
      "text": "(Wahyahhhh...!?)"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 110.1,
      "end_time": 111.6,
      "text": "(...Th-That's right)"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 111.8,
      "end_time": 116.3,
      "text": "(If it's Kishi-sa, and I put all my feelings into it...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 117.0,
      "end_time": 120.1,
      "text": "(Wake up... Satsuki-chan!)"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 127.1,
      "end_time": 128.5,
      "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 128.7,
      "end_time": 129.7,
      "text": "Whoa...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 130.0,
      "end_time": 132.1,
      "text": "What the hell are you guys doing?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 132.3,
      "end_time": 134.2,
      "text": "S-Satsuki-chan?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 136.6,
      "end_time": 138.2,
      "text": "I'm so happy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 138.5,
      "end_time": 140.6,
      "text": "H-Hey, Yukino..."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 145.5,
      "end_time": 147.2,
      "text": "...Thanks"
    }
  ],
